<title>UK: BALTIC FREIGHT INDEX FELL FOUR POINTS TO 1,280.</title>
<headline>BALTIC FREIGHT INDEX FELL FOUR POINTS TO 1,280.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Baltic Freight Index for spot dry cargo shipping rates fell to 1,280 today from 1,284 on Aug 7, with the base being Jan 4 1985 equals</p>
<p>1,000. The BFI is based on the following sub-indices with rates</p>
<p>in dollars per tonne.</p>
<p> Route Index     Rate   Prev Index  Rate</p>
<p>   1    1360    12.343	  1356    12.314</p>
<p>   1a   1252  9486.000	  1260  9543.000</p>
